    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Presenting 13 The Beeches, a fantastic four bedroom, four bathroom detached house conveniently situated in a highly sought after development of Drumgola Wood within walking distance to Cavan town. The property offers spectacular views across the surrounding countryside from the front door as well as generous well-proportioned living accommodation with the benefit of a secure rear patio that acts as a natural suntrap. \r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises of welcoming entrance hallway and access to a spacious living room with solid fuel stove. Off the hallway is an airy sitting room currently being used as a home office, the sitting room/office conveniently leads to the large fully equipped stylish kitchen / dining area with access to the rear gardens. The downstairs is completed with a convenient guest bathroom and utility room. \r\n\r\nUpstairs there are two expansive double bedrooms, both with an en-suite and fitted wardrobes. There is a further generous two generous bedrooms with fitted wardrobes. The upstairs is completed with a spacious family bathroom. \r\n\r\nThe property comes to the market with off street parking, oil fired central heating and double-glazed windows throughout. \r\n\r\nMore about the location…\r\nSituated within walking distance to Cavan Town, number 13 The Beeches is a short walk to all the local amenities. There are two local secondary schools approximately 1km away, St. Patricks College and Loreto College. There are two primary schools close by in the form of Farnham and Butlerbridge, there is also a creche within the development. There is a local link transport system at the entrance of the development. Cavan General Hospital is within walking distance via the greenway. There is a host of sports facilities including gym, GAA grounds and soccer facilities nearby."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance hallway – 2.59m x 5.62m \r\nWelcoming entrance hallway. \r\nLiving room – 3.63m x 3.88m\r\nSpacious living room and solid fuel stove.\r\nSitting room / Office – 3.60m x 5.16m \r\nAiry sitting room currently being used as a home office.\r\nKitchen / Dining Room – 3.38m x 6.25m\r\nLarge and fully equipped kitchen / dining room with convenient access to the secure gardens. \r\nGuest Bathroom – 1.98m x 1.62m\r\nConvenient guest bathroom with WC and sink. \r\nUtility room – 2.12m x 3.13m\r\nHighly convenient utility room plumbed for all appliances. \r\n \r\nUpstairs\r\nBedroom 1 – 3.09m x 3.63m \r\nLarge double bedroom overlooking the rear patio.\r\nBedroom 2 – 3.18m x 3.85m \r\nLarge double bedroom overlooking the rear patio. \r\nMain bedroom – 4.92m x 3.26m \r\nGenerous double bedroom with ample built in wardrobe space with access to an en-suite. \r\nEn-suite – 1.09m x 2.73m \r\nSpacious en-suite with WC, sink and shower. \r\nBedroom 4 – 3.79m x 4.92m \r\nSpacious double bedroom with en-suite. \r\nEn-suite – 3.79m x 1.01m \r\nConvenient fully equipped en-suite with WC, sink and shower. \r\nFamily Bathroom – 2.57m x 1.96m \r\nSpacious fully equipped bathroom, including wash-hand basin, WC, bath and shower. \r\nLanding – 6.20m x 2.67m \r\nOpen airy landing flooded with natural light."
      },
